        "original_id": "a165a6dc-65b6-5436-9e4f-23a004f85341",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: NRG Energy, Raymond James Financial\n- Places: West Windsor Township, New Jersey; Houston, Texas; NRG Park\n- People: Thomas James, Robert James\n- Topics: Financial services, energy\n\nFacts:\n- NRG Energy, Inc. is a large American energy company with dual headquarters in West Windsor Township, New Jersey, and Houston, Texas.\n- Raymond James Financial is an American diversified holding company that provides financial services to individuals, corporations, and municipalities through subsidiaries focused mainly on investment and financial planning, as well as investment banking and asset management.\n- NRG Park, formerly called Reliant Park and Astrodomain, is a complex in Houston, Texas, named after NRG Energy.\n- Thomas James, born in 1942 or 1943, is an American billionaire businessman who served as chairman of Raymond James Financial, a company founded by his father Robert James, for 30 years.",
